                      "content": "The bell is a peek: the newest unread items, mark read, open, nothing else, and it forgets what you did not act on. Updates is the durable inbox: every message that was ever sent, filtered by follow, record, delivery outcome and date, with archive, bulk selection and the delivery record for each message. Keep both, and never rebuild one inside the other.",
