              "fill": "$ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Tabra is a research instrument, and research is done from the keyboard. Every interactive element takes focus, every focused element shows the same ring, and every surface that traps focus gives it back to whatever opened it. Nothing here is optional.",
