                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A solid 2 px ring in $focus-ring, offset 2 px from the control edge so the surface behind stays visible, with a corner radius 2 px larger than the control it surrounds. It measures 9.4 to 1 against the page and against raised cards. The earlier 35 percent wash sat at about 1.9 to 1 and is gone. On brand, danger or any dark fill the ring switches to $focus-ring-inverse. It is the same ring on every interactive element — never a colour change, never a shadow, never removed.",
