                  "content": "The ring is drawn on the product screens, not only here. Home shows the composer send with the inverse ring on its brand fill. Conversation shows citation marker 1. Search shows the jurisdiction filter. Updates shows an inbox row. Issues shows an issue name link. Search on mobile shows a result row that is also the 44 high touch target.",
