    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "i96qs",
      "x": 66080,
      "y": 94941,
      "name": "Email — Delivery notes",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "States coverage for this workstream\n\nPopulated: all seven frames above.\nLoading, empty and recoverable error for Updates and Following are defined once on the desktop frames 'Updates — Loading' and 'Updates — Empty and error'; the mobile frames reuse those treatments unchanged.\nEmails have no loading or empty state: an email is only sent when there is a change to report. A failed send is reported in the app as the 'Email copy could not be delivered' row, not as an email.\nFocus: the ring is shown on 'Edit follow' (Subscription detail), 'Open the substitute' (Updates — Mobile, detail) and 'Save follow' (Following — Mobile, follow sheet)."
    },
