              "id": "v9gWc",
              "name": "Section Note",
              "fill": "$ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1180,
              "content": "No divergence. The scale is shadcn's Tailwind default, unchanged, so nothing here needs a theme override. The two reading tokens are additions rather than overrides: they name a role the scale does not have, and both resolve to values already on the scale.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": "$text-sm",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ibVK4",
              "name": "Permitted use",
              "fill": "$ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1180,
              "content": "Permitted use, by size. 12 is the floor for anything a reader must read, and it carries metadata, timestamps, provenance and coverage notes. 14 is the interface default: navigation, form labels, result rows, controls and mono identifiers. 16 is body copy, answer text and descriptions. 18 is sub-headings, card titles and legislative body text. 20 is section titles. 24 and above are display sizes in Fraunces, one per screen.",
