                                                          "content": "1. Colorado would require local governments to permit duplexes, triplexes and townhomes on lots zoned for a single-unit detached dwelling in tier one urban areas. [1]\n    Annotation by Alex Reyes: Tier one urban area is defined in Sec. 2, worth quoting if the reader asks.\n2. The requirement is not in force. It takes effect January 1, 2027, and a municipality that adopts a compliant ordinance earlier may apply that ordinance on adoption. [2]\n3. Washington would require written notice of relocation assistance eligibility no less than 120 days before the required vacation date. [3]\n4. Washington fixes the notice period in statute while the Colorado bill leaves notice requirements to local ordinance. This is a difference in the two texts, not a conclusion about which applies to a given property. [4]\n    Annotation by Alex Reyes: Do not phrase this as which state protects tenants more.",
                                                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                                          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
                                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                          "type": "text",
                                                          "id": "EM019",
                                                          "name": "Text",
                                                          "fill": "$ink-subtle",
                                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                                          "content": "Citations",
                                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                                                          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
                                                          "fontWeight": "600"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                          "type": "text",
                                                          "id": "XE1dx",
                                                          "name": "Text",
                                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                                          "content": "[1] CO HB26-1142, Middle Housing Density and Permitting Reform. Committee substitute of February 3, 2026, Sec. 4(b). Status date February 3, 2026. Colorado General Assembly, official bill text.\n[2] CO HB26-1142, committee substitute of February 3, 2026, Sec. 12(1). Colorado General Assembly, official bill text.\n[3] WA SB 5218, Tenant Relocation Assistance and Notice Requirements. Engrossed version of February 5, 2026, Sec. 3(2). Status date February 5, 2026. Washington State Legislature, official bill text.\n[4] WA SB 5218, Sec. 3(2) and CO HB26-1142, Sec. 7(1), as identified above.",
                                                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                                          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
                                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                          "type": "text",
                                                          "id": "Iu5pf",
                                                          "name": "Text",
                                                          "fill": "$ink-subtle",
                                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                                          "content": "Open questions and limitations",
                                                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                                                          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
                                                          "fontWeight": "600"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                          "type": "text",
                                                          "id": "N93Dt",
                                                          "name": "Text",
                                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                                          "content": "Tier one urban area is not defined in the quoted section. The definition sits in Sec. 2 and was not reviewed for this brief.\nNo later version was compared. Amendments after February 5, 2026 are outside this reporting interval.\nThis is personal research by Alex Reyes. It is not legal advice, not an approved report and not a published document.",
                                                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                                          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
                                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                                        }
                                                      ]
                                                    }
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          }
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
